<title>NETHERLANDS: WEWELER FIRST-HALF NET PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>WEWELER FIRST-HALF NET PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>APELDOORN, Netherlands 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     2.25 vs   2.93</p>
<p>    Turnover				42.5  vs  41.4</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     4.0  vs   5.1</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.5  vs   0.5</p>
<p>    Tax					1.3  vs   1.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Suspension maker Weweler NV previously said it</p>
<p>expected profit growth to slow down in 1996 after a 40 percent</p>
<p>profit rise in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
